# AuthSphere Web Frontend Environment Configuration

# --- API & Gateway Configuration ---
# Base URL for API requests:
# - Local Dev (default): Leave empty. Vite dev server proxies '/api/*' to http://localhost:3000.
# - Direct / Custom Host: Set to target backend URL (e.g., http://localhost:3000).
# - Production (Vercel): Leave unset to route through Vercel Edge Reverse Proxy (/api/*).
VITE_API_URL=
